    <!--
      The document register and one more WhatsApp template.

      Three documents, one per link target the register supports: an agreement,
      a tenant ID proof and a unit-level deposit receipt. lhc.document.file is
      required, so each carries a real (tiny) PDF rather than an empty binary —
      an empty one would download as a zero-byte file and make the register look
      broken the first time somebody clicks it.

      There is nothing to seed for the audit trail. It reads Odoo's own chatter
      tracking, so it fills itself the moment any tracked field on a demo record
      is edited.
    -->

