    <!-- A fourth WhatsApp template alongside the three seeded in data/.
         Nothing is ever sent: the body is copied to the clipboard and pasted
         into WhatsApp by hand, which is why the placeholders are plain text. -->
    <record id="demo_wa_vacate_reminder" model="lhc.wa.template">
        <field name="name">Vacate — handover checklist reminder</field>
        <field name="template_type">other</field>
        <field name="body">Dear {{tenant_name}},

This is a reminder that your handover for {{unit_code}} is scheduled on
{{vacate_date}}. Please keep the following ready:

  • All sets of keys
  • Final EB meter reading
  • Cleared maintenance dues

The deposit refund is settled after the fixture check on the same day.

— Lovely Home Creators</field>
    </record>

